  "noticeEn": "The latest official GitHub release is v0.9.0 (2026-03-28); the installer reports 1.0.0 internally (a SECTL build naming habit; it is the same package). The development branch already has automatic points, dashboards, PostgreSQL sync and MCP, but no stable release yet. The v1.0.x folder on the mirror contains unpublished draft builds that cannot be downloaded and are not listed here. Downloads use the SECTL GitHub mirror for faster access in China; files match the official GitHub release and can be checked against the SHA256 below.",
